{
  "public_post": "URGENT UPDATE: All bread baked with this week's flour has been recalled. Please do NOT eat any co‑op bread today. We will refund any purchases made and will have fresh, safe flour ready for tomorrow's baking. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Team, we need to execute the recall immediately: collect all unsold loaves, issue refunds to anyone who bought today, and arrange a safe flour shipment for tomorrow. Who can handle refunds at the stand and who can manage the pickup of the contaminated loaves? Also, let's draft a compensation offer (e.g., free bread for a week) to maintain goodwill.",
  "reason": "To protect villagers' health with a clear recall and coordinate the co‑op's response and compensation."
}

{
  "public_post": "Important notice: All bread baked this week is confirmed contaminated. Do NOT eat any loaves and return them to the co‑op for a full refund. Sales are halted while we secure safe flour and will resume with safe bread as soon as possible.",
  "coop_message": "We must recall and discard every loaf baked this week, stop all baking immediately, secure a new safe flour supply, and set up a full refund/compensation process for residents; let's also discuss how to cover the co‑op's losses.",
  "reason": "To protect villagers' health by recalling contaminated bread and to coordinate the emergency response and compensation within the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Recall update: All contaminated loaves are being collected today; affected residents will be fully reimbursed and we aim to have safe bread available tomorrow.",
  "coop_message": "Team, we must organize immediate pickup of all loaves, process refunds/compensation for each resident, secure a new safe flour batch (e.g., Supplier X), schedule baking for tomorrow, and draft a clear timeline to share with villagers.",
  "reason": "To inform villagers about the recall and compensation while coordinating the recovery plan with the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Attention villagers: All bread sold this week is being recalled due to a contaminated flour batch. Please stop eating any co-op bread immediately and bring any loaves you have to the bakery for a full refund. We are arranging a safe flour supply and will resume sales as soon as possible. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Team, we need to execute an immediate recall: collect all unsold loaves, refund every resident who bought bread, and discard contaminated inventory. Let's source a verified flour batch today, halt baking until it arrives, and draft a compensation plan (full refunds plus a complimentary loaf once safe bread is back). Please confirm who will handle refunds, inventory collection, and new flour procurement.",
  "reason": "We must protect villagers' health by recalling the bread and coordinating refunds and a safe flour supply."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: safe flour has arrived and we will resume baking tomorrow; all refunds have been processed and every resident will receive a complimentary loaf each day for the next week as compensation. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Team, please confirm all refunds are completed, prepare the free‑loaf vouchers (one per resident per day for 7 days), schedule tomorrow's bake with the new flour, and assign someone to hand out vouchers at the stand.",
  "reason": "To inform villagers of resumed service and compensation while coordinating final refund and voucher tasks."
}

{
  "public_post": "Recall update: All contaminated loaves have been collected and refunds issued. Each affected resident will receive a complimentary loaf for each day missed. Safe, fresh bread will be available tomorrow morning. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Team, refunds have been processed at the stand (Gus) and inventory pickup is complete (Fay). New safe flour from Supplier X is arriving tonight; Quin, please verify quality and start baking prep. I will draft the compensation notice (free loaf per missed day) and share the timeline with villagers. Confirm once tasks are done.",
  "reason": "To finalize the recall, compensate residents, and announce safe bread resumption."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: Safe flour will arrive tomorrow; all contaminated loaves are being collected today and refunds are being issued. As compensation, each resident will receive a free loaf each day for the next week. Please bring any loaves you have to the bakery for pickup.",
  "coop_message": "Team, please confirm: (1) Quin, handle all resident refunds at the stand; (2) Fay, coordinate pickup of contaminated loaves from homes; (3) Ava, secure the new verified flour shipment (expected tomorrow morning) and schedule baking; (4) I will draft the compensation notice for villagers. Let’s have status updates by end of day.",
  "reason": "We need to keep villagers informed, assure them of compensation, and assign clear tasks to complete the recall and resume safe baking."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news, villagers! Safe flour has arrived and we are back to baking fresh, healthy bread today. Remember, each resident will continue to receive a complimentary loaf every day this week as thanks for your patience. Come by the stand for your free loaf and any extra you need.",
  "coop_message": "Team, today we resume sales with the new safe flour. Quin, track daily sales and inventory; Fay, manage the distribution of the complimentary loaves; Ava, monitor stock levels and handle any resident concerns; I'll handle accounting and update the compensation tracker. Let's ensure a smooth restart.",
  "reason": "To inform villagers that safe bread is back and encourage purchases while coordinating the co-op's restart tasks."
}

{
  "public_post": "Urgent notice: The flour used for this week's bread was contaminated and may have caused illness; please stop eating any co‑op bread immediately, seek medical attention if you feel unwell, and come to the bakery for a full refund and free medical vouchers. We sincerely apologize for this serious mistake.",
  "coop_message": "Team, we must immediately disclose the contamination to the villagers, halt all sales, set up a medical assistance fund, process full refunds for every loaf sold this week, and coordinate with the clinic to track health reports; please confirm who will handle refunds, medical vouchers, and communication with authorities.",
  "reason": "We need to be transparent about the contamination and protect villagers' health."
}

{
  "public_post": "Day 6 update: All bread is safe and our complimentary‑loaf program continues tomorrow (the final free loaf day). After tomorrow we’ll return to regular sales at the usual price. Thank you for your patience and continued support of the co‑op!",
  "coop_message": "Team, today we sold 30 regular loaves and handed out the 30th free loaf. All refunds have been processed and the total cost of the recall + 7 days of free loaves is 210 coins. To cover the shortfall, I propose each member contributes 7 coins this week. Please confirm your agreement and arrange the payments.",
  "reason": "Inform villagers that the free‑loaf compensation ends soon and coordinate final accounting and member contributions with the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Final update: All contaminated bread has been recalled, safe flour is now in use, and the complimentary‑loaf program ends tomorrow; regular sales resume on day 7 at the usual price. Thank you for your patience—please let us know if anyone still feels unwell.",
  "coop_message": "Team, today we sold 30 regular loaves and distributed 30 free loaves; refunds for 30 contaminated loaves are complete. The total cost of free loaves and refunds leaves a shortfall of 90 coins. I propose each member contributes 30 coins this week to cover it—please confirm your contribution by tonight.",
  "reason": "Give villagers a closing update and coordinate final accounting and cost‑sharing with co‑op members."
}
